  "description": "<p>The Mulgara documentation suggests that querying against a datatyping model using the predicates mulgara:gt and mulgara:lt should be possible for XSD datatype int.  However these do not work, but mulgara:before and mulgara:after do work.</p>\n\n<p>eg RELS-EXT:</p>\n\n<p>&lt;rdf:RDF xmlns:fedora-model=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\" xmlns:myns=\"http://www.example.org/myns#\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/ns:pid\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;myns:temperature rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int\"&gt;30&lt;/myns:temperature&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;</p>\n\n<p>Non-working Query:</p>\n\n<p>select $object $temp from &lt;#ri&gt;                                                      <br/>\nwhere <br/>\n$object &lt;<a href=\"http://www.example.org/myns#temperature\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.example.org/myns#temperature</a>&gt; $temp in &lt;#ri&gt;<br/>\nand $temp &lt;<a href=\"http://mulgara.org/mulgara#gt\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mulgara.org/mulgara#gt</a>&gt; '10'^^&lt;xml-schema:int&gt; in &lt;#xsd&gt;</p>\n\n<p>Working Query:</p>\n\n<p>select $object $temp from &lt;#ri&gt;                                                      <br/>\nwhere <br/>\n$object &lt;<a href=\"http://www.example.org/myns#temperature\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.example.org/myns#temperature</a>&gt; $temp in &lt;#ri&gt;<br/>\nand $temp &lt;<a href=\"http://mulgara.org/mulgara#after\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mulgara.org/mulgara#after</a>&gt; '10'^^&lt;xml-schema:int&gt; in &lt;#xsd&gt;</p>",
